// --- Hierarchical cycle profile (emitted by src/codegen) -------------
// One table entry per emitted layer plus one per enclosing module
// scope, in execution order. A scope's index is always below its
// children's, so prof_report() rolls the leaves up in a single
// reverse pass. -DNO_PROFILE_REPORT drops the report function and
// its call; the counters themselves are two instructions per layer
// and stay, so the accuracy path is identical either way.
